The original called the virtual `GetType()` twice. This version calls it once and keeps the result in a local, removing one virtual dispatch per call. The checks and their order are unchanged, so the returned values are the same.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 FieldBase::GetNumValues(void) const
{
    if (!IsValid())
        return 0;

    const FIT_UINT8 type = GetType();
    if (type != FIT_BASE_TYPE_STRING)
        return (FIT_UINT8)(values.size() / baseTypeSizes[type & FIT_BASE_TYPE_NUM_MASK]);

    return (FIT_UINT8)stringIndexes.size();
}
```